==English==

===Etymology===
U.S. regional variation of “[[champ#Verb|champ]]” (verb)

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/tʃɒmp/}}
* {{a|US}} {{enPR|chŏmp}}, {{IPA|/t͡ʃɔmp/}}

* {{audio|en-us-chomp.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɒmp}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The act of [[chomping]] {{qualifier|see below}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{context|intransitive|lang=en}} To [[bite]] or [[munch]] [[loudly]] or heavily.
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To [[chew]] something loudly or heavily.
#: ''The dog '''chomped''' the treat and swallowed it in one gulp.''

